    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Myoyo une natindiŵele pameso pa AMBUJE ni napopesile masiku makumi mcece, musi ni cilo, ligongo namanyilile kuti ŵasimicisye yakumjonanga jemanja. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Une napopesile camti myiyi, ‘Ŵalakwe AMBUJE Mlungu jwetu, conde akajonanga ŵandu ŵawoŵa, ŵiŵasagwile ŵalakwe asyene kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵa ŵalakwe. Ŵandu ŵiŵakulupwisye ni macili gawo gekulungwa, soni ŵalakwe ŵakopwesye mcilambo ca Iguputo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abulahamu, Isaki ni Yakobo, acinangolo ŵa ŵandu ŵeleŵa, ŵaliji ŵandu ŵakulupicika kwa ŵalakwe. Conde ŵaganicisye acinangolo ŵeleŵa, soni akusagaŵalanjila makani gakwatendela ŵalakwe ŵandu ŵeleŵa, ni kusakala kwawo ni ulemwa wawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ligongo naga ŵalakwe akwajonanga ŵandu ŵawoŵa, ŵandu ŵa ku Iguputo tacisala kuti ŵalakwe alepele kwajinjisya Aisalaeli ku cilambo cimwaŵikene nawo cilanga. Tacijila soni kuti: Ŵakopwesye ŵandu ŵawo kuti akawulajile ku cipululu, pakuŵa ŵaliji mkuŵengana nawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 9:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵalakwe AMBUJE mwasagwile Aisalaeli kuti aŵe ŵandu ŵenu, soni mwakopwesye ku Iguputo mwamacili genu gamakulungwa.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.9.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.9.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
